            "lead": "Xenical:",
            "text": "approved April 23, 1999 as a new molecular entity (NDA 020766). Approved for obesity management, including weight loss and keeping weight off, with a reduced-calorie diet, in people with a BMI of 30 or more, or 27 or more with other risk factors such as high blood pressure, diabetes or high blood fats.",
            "src": [
              {
